<div class="label">
Who We Are
</div>

<h2 class="title">
A group built around <span class="gold">capital, knowledge and long-term thinking.</span>
</h2>

<p class="text">
Bikusura Group brings together investment activities, business
opportunities and educational initiatives under one long-term vision.
The Group seeks to understand businesses, markets and opportunities
before making important decisions.
</p>

<p class="text" style="margin-top:18px;">
Our philosophy combines disciplined capital allocation with
entrepreneurial thinking and continuous learning. We believe that
wealth creation is not only about capital — it is also about knowledge,
patience, responsible decision-making and the ability to think beyond
the immediate horizon.
</p>

<div class="feature-list">

